<TITLE>Horn</TITLE>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT>Low-pitch and high-pitch double horns are now standard on all models. A compact, lightweight flat-type horn is used for each horn.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>Both the low-pitch and high-pitch horns are installed on the radiator upper support.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
